Subject: [PATCH 01/13] Switch safe_regex to Latin1 charset

Fix [GHSA-23xh-2qxr-3xv8](https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/security/advisories/GHSA-23xh-2qxr-3xv8)

Signed-off-by: Yan Avlasov <yavlasov@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Ryan Northey <ryan@synca.io>
